{
  "statement": "The requirements I propose focus on ensuring the safety and reliability of the bookkeeping system. SAF-01 guarantees accurate recording of transactions to prevent data loss. SAF-02 enforces double-entry bookkeeping principles, enhancing integrity. SAF-03 maintains a comprehensive audit trail for 7 years, ensuring accountability. SAF-04 provides error handling to recover from faults. SAF-05 ensures essential functionalities remain accessible during partial outages. SAF-06 validates currency conversions to prevent discrepancies, and SAF-07 mandates regular backups to protect against data loss. These requirements collectively create a robust safety framework for the system.",
